00:46:04,572 --> 00:46:07,072
もう一回聴きたい！
I want to hear it again!

675
00:46:07,072 --> 00:46:10,072
ちょっと、あの、体力がない...
I, uh, don't have the stamina...

676
00:46:10,072 --> 00:46:12,572
体力かー
Ah, stamina.

677
00:46:12,572 --> 00:46:15,572
じゃあ、奏、歌う？一緒に
Then, Kanade, do you want to sing together?

678
00:46:15,572 --> 00:46:17,072
いいよ！やったー！
Sure! Yay!

679
00:46:17,072 --> 00:46:19,072
みんな、何歌う？何歌う？
What should we sing, everyone?

680
00:46:19,072 --> 00:46:21,072
乗ろう、乗ろう！あの曲行っちゃいますか！
Let's get into it! Should we go with THAT song?

681
00:46:21,072 --> 00:46:23,072
おっ、何？何？
Oh? What is it? What is it?

682
00:46:23,072 --> 00:46:25,072
何だろう？なんだと思う？
I wonder what it is? What do you think?

683
00:46:25,072 --> 00:46:28,072
やっぱり、お星様がキラキラしたら、もう一回キラキラしたいんじゃないの？
I mean, since the stars were shining, shouldn't we shine once more?

684
00:46:28,072 --> 00:46:30,572
なるほど、なるほど！プラネタリウムから外に出ちゃう？
I see, I see! Are we stepping outside of the planetarium?

685
00:46:30,572 --> 00:46:33,072
天体観測！それ！
Astronomical Observation! That's the one!

686
00:46:33,072 --> 00:46:35,072
何の曲かなー？
I wonder what song it is...

687
00:46:35,072 --> 00:46:39,072
じゃあ行きましょう！お願いしまーす！
Then let's do it! Here we go!

688
00:46:39,072 --> 00:46:43,072
どっちからだっけ？えっ、どっちからだっけ？奏で！
Who starts first? Uh, who starts first? Kanade!

689
00:47:04,872 --> 00:47:08,072
午前二時 フミキリに
At 2:00 AM, at the railroad crossing,

690
00:47:08,072 --> 00:47:12,872
望遠鏡を担いでった
I carried my telescope.

691
00:47:12,872 --> 00:47:16,572
ベルトに結んだラジオ
With the radio tied to my belt,

692
00:47:16,572 --> 00:47:21,072
雨は降らないらしい
it seemed like it wouldn't rain.

693
00:47:21,072 --> 00:47:24,572
二分後に君が来た
Two minutes later, you arrived,

694
00:47:24,572 --> 00:47:28,272
大袈裟な荷物しょって来た
carrying an exaggerated amount of luggage.

695
00:47:28,272 --> 00:47:32,072
始めようか 天体観測
Shall we begin our astronomical observation,

696
00:47:32,072 --> 00:47:36,072
ほうき星を探して
searching for a comet?

697
00:47:36,072 --> 00:47:39,572
深い闇に飲まれないように
Trying our best not to get swallowed

698
00:47:39,572 --> 00:47:43,072
精一杯だった
by the deep darkness.

699
00:47:43,072 --> 00:47:46,572
君の震える手を
Trying to hold your trembling hand

700
00:47:46,572 --> 00:47:51,072
握ろうとしたあの日は
on that day...

701
00:47:51,072 --> 00:47:54,572
見えないモノを見ようとして
Trying to see the invisible,

702
00:47:54,572 --> 00:47:58,072
望遠鏡を覗き込んだ
we peered into the telescope.

703
00:47:58,072 --> 00:48:01,572
静寂を切り裂いて
Ripping through the silence,

704
00:48:01,572 --> 00:48:05,072
いくつも声が生まれたよ
countless voices were born.

705
00:48:05,072 --> 00:48:08,572
明日が僕らを呼んだって
Even if tomorrow called out to us,

706
00:48:08,572 --> 00:48:12,072
返事もろくにしなかった
we barely gave it an answer.

707
00:48:12,072 --> 00:48:15,572
「イマ」というほうき星
Chasing after that comet

708
00:48:15,572 --> 00:48:20,072
君と二人追いかけていた
called "The Present" together.

709
00:48:20,072 --> 00:48:23,572
気が付けばいつだって
Before we knew it, we were always

710
00:48:23,572 --> 00:48:27,072
ひたすら何か探している
searching for something.

711
00:48:27,072 --> 00:48:30,572
幸せの定義とか
The definition of happiness,

712
00:48:30,572 --> 00:48:34,072
哀しみの置き場とか
or where to put our sadness...

713
00:48:34,072 --> 00:48:37,572
生まれたら死ぬまで
From the moment we are born until we die,

714
00:48:37,572 --> 00:48:41,072
ずっと探してる
we are always searching.

715
00:48:41,072 --> 00:48:44,572
さぁ 始めようか 天体観測
Now, shall we begin our astronomical observation,

716
00:48:44,572 --> 00:48:48,072
ほうき星を探して
searching for a comet?

717
00:48:48,072 --> 00:48:51,572
今まで見つけたモノは
Everything we've found so far,

718
00:48:51,572 --> 00:48:55,072
全部覚えている
I remember it all.

719
00:48:55,072 --> 00:48:58,572
君の震える手を
Even the pain of not being able

720
00:48:58,572 --> 00:49:03,072
握れなかった痛みも
to hold your trembling hand.

721
00:49:03,072 --> 00:49:06,572
知らないモノを知ろうとして
Trying to know the unknown,

722
00:49:06,572 --> 00:49:10,072
望遠鏡を覗き込んだ
we peered into the telescope.

723
00:49:10,072 --> 00:49:13,572
暗闇を照らす様な
Searching for a faint light

724
00:49:13,572 --> 00:49:17,072
微かな光 探したよ
that would light up the darkness.

725
00:49:17,072 --> 00:49:20,572
そうして知った痛みを
The pain that we learned back then,

726
00:49:20,572 --> 00:49:24,072
未だに僕は覚えている
I still remember it even now.

727
00:49:24,072 --> 00:49:27,572
「イマ」というほうき星
Chasing after that comet

728
00:49:27,572 --> 00:49:32,072
今も一人追いかけている
called "The Present" all alone now.

729
00:49:11,072 --> 00:49:35,572
背が伸びるにつれて
As I grew taller, the things

730
00:49:15,072 --> 00:49:19,072
伝えたい事も増えてった
I wanted to tell you grew too.

731
00:49:19,072 --> 00:49:22,572
宛名の無い手紙も
Even the unaddressed letters

732
00:49:22,572 --> 00:49:26,072
崩れる程重なった
piled up so high they collapsed.

733
00:49:26,072 --> 00:49:29,572
僕は元気でいるよ
I am doing well,

734
00:49:29,572 --> 00:49:33,072
心配事も少ないよ
and I don't have many worries.

735
00:49:33,072 --> 00:49:36,572
ただひとつ 今も思い出すよ
It's just that there's one thing I still remember...

736
00:49:36,572 --> 00:49:41,072
予報外れの雨に
Drenched by the unexpected rain,

737
00:49:41,072 --> 00:49:44,572
打たれて泣きだしそうな
as if you were about to cry...

738
00:49:44,572 --> 00:49:47,572
君の震える手を
That day when I couldn't hold

739
00:49:47,572 --> 00:49:50,072
握れなかった あの日を
your trembling hand...

740
00:49:50,072 --> 00:49:53,072
見えてるモノを見落として
Overlooking the things right in front of us,

741
00:49:53,072 --> 00:49:56,072
望遠鏡をまた担いで
I shouldered my telescope once again.

742
00:49:56,072 --> 00:49:59,072
静寂と暗闇の帰り道を駆け抜けた
I ran through the silence and darkness on the way home.

743
00:49:59,072 --> 00:50:00,072
そうして知った痛みが
And the pain I felt then...

744
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:01,280
帰り道を駆け抜けた
...I ran through the way home.

745
00:50:01,280 --> 00:50:06,880
そうして知った痛みが 未だに僕を支えている
And the pain I learned then still supports me.

746
00:50:06,880 --> 00:50:12,380
「イマ」というほうき星 今も一人追いかけている
A comet named "Now," I'm still chasing it alone.

747
00:50:12,380 --> 00:50:18,480
もう一度君に会おうとして 望遠鏡をまた担いで
Hoping to meet you once again, I shoulder my telescope once more.

748
00:50:18,480 --> 00:50:24,380
前と同じ午前二時 フミキリまで駆けてくよ
At 2:00 AM, just like before, I'll run to the railroad crossing.

749
00:50:24,380 --> 00:50:30,580
始めようか天体観測 二分後に君が来なくとも
Let's begin our astronomical observation, even if you don't show up in two minutes.

750
00:50:30,580 --> 00:50:36,780
「イマ」というほうき星 君と二人追いかけている
A comet named "Now," we are both chasing it together.

751
00:50:51,080 --> 00:50:53,080
はあー、疲れた
Ah, that was tiring!

752
00:50:54,080 --> 00:50:56,280
めっちゃ踊ってくれた
You danced so much!

753
00:50:56,280 --> 00:50:58,180
踊ってたっていうかパフォーマンス？
More of a performance than dancing!

754
00:50:58,180 --> 00:51:00,080
違う、体が勝手に...
No, my body just moved on its own...

755
00:51:00,080 --> 00:51:04,080
二人でね、ほうき星探しに行ってくれたんだよね。ちょっとね
You two went looking for the comet together, didn't you? A little bit, yeah.

756
00:51:04,080 --> 00:51:05,580
あー、疲れたね
Ah, I'm so tired.

757
00:51:05,580 --> 00:51:08,580
めっちゃ歩き回っちゃった。歩き回ってたね
I ended up walking around a lot! You sure were!

758
00:51:08,580 --> 00:51:11,380
全員、ちょっとヘトヘト...
Everyone is a bit exhausted...

759
00:51:11,380 --> 00:51:15,580
はじめはもう一曲目からヘトヘトですけど
We're exhausted from just the first song, but...

760
00:51:16,080 --> 00:51:21,080
でもね、このままちょっとらでんと番長の二人を聴きたいな、なんて思ってるんですけども
But you know, I really want to hear Raden and Bancho sing next!

761
00:51:21,080 --> 00:51:23,580
いいよ！いい？
Sure! Is it okay?

762
00:51:23,580 --> 00:51:26,580
徒歩じゃなくて チャリで駆け上がりますか
Instead of walking, shall we climb up on a bike?

763
00:51:26,580 --> 00:51:30,080
チャリで。行きましょう。行ってらっしゃい
On a bike. Let's do it! Good luck!

764
00:51:30,580 --> 00:51:32,880
はい、じゃあ準備いいですか？
Alright, are you ready?

765
00:51:32,880 --> 00:51:35,580
OK。はい、じゃあ音楽お願いします
Okay. Music please!

766
00:51:36,580 --> 00:51:39,080
きた、夏色！
Here it is, Natsuiro!

767
00:51:39,080 --> 00:51:42,580
夏といえばこれでしょう！
This is the ultimate summer song!

768
00:51:45,080 --> 00:51:48,580
チャリン、チャリン、チャリン...
Ring ring, ring ring...

769
00:51:52,580 --> 00:51:57,380
駐車場のネコはアクビをしながら
The cat in the parking lot yawns,

770
00:51:57,380 --> 00:52:00,880
今日も一日を過ごしてゆく
and spends another day like this.

771
00:52:00,880 --> 00:52:06,080
何も変わらない 穏やかな街並み
In a quiet town where nothing ever changes.

772
00:52:06,080 --> 00:52:10,580
みんな夏が来たって浮かれ気分なのに
Even though everyone is excited that summer has arrived,

773
00:52:10,580 --> 00:52:14,280
君は一人さええない顔してるね
you have such a gloomy expression all by yourself.

774
00:52:14,280 --> 00:52:19,080
そうだ君に 見せたい物があるんだ
That's right, there is something I want to show you.

775
00:52:19,080 --> 00:52:23,580
大きな五時半の夕やけ
A grand sunset at 5:30,

776
00:52:23,580 --> 00:52:27,580
子供の頃と同じように
just like when we were children.

777
00:52:27,580 --> 00:52:31,580
海も空も雲も 僕等でさえも
The sea, the sky, the clouds, and even us...

778
00:52:31,580 --> 00:52:35,580
染めてゆくから...
...are being painted by it.

779
00:52:35,580 --> 00:52:41,080
この長い長い下り坂を 君を自転車の後ろに乗せて
Riding a bicycle down this long, long slope with you on the back,

780
00:52:41,080 --> 00:52:46,080
ブレーキいっぱい握りしめて
gripping the brakes tight...

781
00:52:46,080 --> 00:52:53,080
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
...and going down slowly, slowly.

782
00:52:54,080 --> 00:52:56,580
下ってくよー
Going down!

783
00:52:56,580 --> 00:52:59,080
うおー！
Whoa!

784
00:53:01,580 --> 00:53:05,880
風鈴の音でウトウトしながら
Dozing off to the sound of wind chimes,

785
00:53:05,880 --> 00:53:09,580
夢見ごこちでヨダレをたらしてる
dreamily drooling a little bit.

786
00:53:09,580 --> 00:53:15,080
いつもと同じ 網戸ごしの風の匂い
Always the same smell of wind through the screen door.

787
00:53:15,080 --> 00:53:19,580
休日でみんなもゴロゴロしてるのに
Even though everyone is lounging around on their day off,

788
00:53:19,580 --> 00:53:23,280
君はずいぶん忙しい顔をしてるね
you have quite a busy expression.

789
00:53:23,280 --> 00:53:28,080
そうだいつかのあの場所へ行こう
That's right, let's go to that place sometime.

790
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:32,580
真夏の夜の波の音は
The sound of the waves on a midsummer night

791
00:53:32,580 --> 00:53:36,580
不思議な程心静かになる
mysteriously calms my heart.

792
00:53:36,580 --> 00:53:44,280
少しだけ全て忘れて 波の音の中包み込まれてゆく
Forget everything for a little while, wrapped in the sound of the waves.

793
00:53:44,280 --> 00:53:49,280
この細い細い裏道を抜けて
Slipping through this narrow, narrow backstreet,

794
00:53:49,280 --> 00:53:52,580
誰もいない大きな夜の海見ながら
looking at the grand night sea with no one else around.

795
00:53:52,580 --> 00:54:02,580
線香花火に二人で ゆっくりゆっくり火をつける
Lighting sparklers together, slowly, slowly lighting the fire.

796
00:54:02,580 --> 00:54:07,580
いつか君の涙が こぼれおちそうになったら
Someday, if your tears are about to fall...

797
00:54:07,580 --> 00:54:12,580
何もしてあげられないけど 少しでもそばにいるよ
...I can't do much for you, but I'll be by your side.

798
00:54:12,580 --> 00:54:18,080
この長い長い下り坂を 君を自転車の後ろに乗せて
Riding a bicycle down this long, long slope with you on the back,

799
00:54:18,080 --> 00:54:24,080
ブレーキいっぱい握りしめて
gripping the brakes tight,

800
00:54:24,080 --> 00:54:28,080
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
going down slowly, slowly.

801
00:54:28,080 --> 00:54:32,080
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
Going down slowly, slowly.

802
00:54:32,080 --> 00:54:38,080
ゆっくりゆっくり下ってく
Going down slowly, slowly.

803
00:54:44,080 --> 00:54:51,080
夏だね！夏が始まった！チャリン、チャリン、最高！
It's summer! Summer has begun! Ring ring, awesome!

804
00:54:54,080 --> 00:54:59,080
ありがとうございました！
Thank you so much!

805
00:55:00,088 --> 00:55:01,388
にゃー！
Yaay!

806
00:55:01,388 --> 00:55:03,288
じゃあちょっと連続なんですけど
Well, it's back-to-back, but...

807
00:55:03,288 --> 00:55:04,188
おっ
Oh!

808
00:55:04,188 --> 00:55:07,488
最後 4 人で歌いたいと思います！
Lastly, we want to sing as the four of us!

809
00:55:07,488 --> 00:55:10,088
おー！何歌うんですか？
Oh! What are we going to sing?

810
00:55:10,088 --> 00:55:12,388
何歌うんだろうね？
What will we sing, I wonder?

811
00:55:12,388 --> 00:55:15,588
じゃあ皆さん聴いてください！おねがいします！
Well then, everyone, please listen! Here we go!

812
00:55:15,588 --> 00:55:17,888
ウィーーアーー！
We Are!

813
00:55:20,588 --> 00:55:23,088
富、名声、力
Wealth, fame, power.

814
00:55:23,088 --> 00:55:27,588
この世のすべてを手に入れた男、海賊王ゴールド・ロジャー
The man who had acquired everything in this world, the Pirate King, Gold Roger.

815
00:55:27,588 --> 00:55:32,488
彼の死に際に放った一言は、人々を海へ駆り立てた
The words he uttered at his death drove people to the seas.

816
00:55:32,488 --> 00:55:37,788
「俺の財宝か？欲しけりゃくれてやる。探せ！この世のすべてをそこに置いてきた！」
"My treasure? If you want it, you can have it. Look for it! I left everything this world has to offer there!"

817
00:55:39,588 --> 00:55:43,088
男たちは、グランドラインを目指し
Men head for the Grand Line...

818
00:55:43,088 --> 00:55:48,088
夢を追い続ける。世はまさに、大海賊時代！
...and continue to pursue their dreams. The world is truly in the Great Pirate Era!

819
00:55:48,088 --> 00:55:53,388
ありったけの夢を かき集め
Gathering up all the pieces of our dreams,

820
00:55:53,388 --> 00:55:59,088
捜し物を捜しに 行くのさ
we're going to search for everything we're looking for.

821
00:55:59,088 --> 00:56:02,088
ONE PIECE

822
00:56:05,588 --> 00:56:11,288
羅針盤なんて 渋滞のもと
A compass will only slow us down.

823
00:56:11,288 --> 00:56:15,588
熱にうかされ 舵をとるのさ
Filled with excitement, I take the helm.

824
00:56:15,588 --> 00:56:19,588
ホコリかぶってた 宝の地図も
If we can prove the dusty old treasure map,

825
00:56:19,588 --> 00:56:28,288
確かめたのなら 伝説じゃない！
then it won't be a legend anymore!

826
00:56:28,288 --> 00:56:34,088
個人的な嵐は 誰かの
It's alright if our internal storms

827
00:56:34,088 --> 00:56:40,588
バイオリズム乗っかって 思い過ごせばいい！
get on someone else's nerves, because we think about them too much!

828
00:56:40,588 --> 00:56:48,588
ありったけの夢を かき集め
Gathering up all the pieces of our dreams,

829
00:56:48,588 --> 00:56:53,088
捜し物を捜しに 行くのさ
we're going to search for everything we're looking for.

830
00:56:53,088 --> 00:56:57,588
ポケットのコイン それと You wanna be my Friend?
A coin in the pocket, and "You wanna be my friend?"

831
00:56:57,588 --> 00:57:06,088
We are, We are on the cruise! ウィーアー！
We are, We are on the cruise! We are!

832
00:57:25,088 --> 00:57:29,088
よっしゃー！いい感じ！
Yes! Looking good!

833
00:57:37,088 --> 00:57:42,588
ぜんぶまに受けて 信じちゃっても
Even though I believe everything they tell me,

834
00:57:42,588 --> 00:57:53,588
肩を押されて 1歩リードさ
if you push me on the shoulder, I'm one step ahead.

835
00:57:53,588 --> 00:57:59,088
今度会えたなら 話すつもりさ
If we ever meet again, I'll tell you all about

836
00:57:59,088 --> 00:58:05,588
それからのことと これからのこと
what I've been doing and where I'm headed next.

837
00:58:05,588 --> 00:58:11,588
つまりいつもピンチは 誰かに
In other words, being in a pinch is always

838
00:58:11,588 --> 00:58:17,588
アピール出来る いいチャンス
a good opportunity to ask for backup

839
00:58:17,588 --> 00:58:20,088
自意識過剰に！
and overcome one's excessive shyness!

840
00:58:20,088 --> 00:58:26,588
しみったれた夜を ぶっとばせ！
Full steam ahead through the stingy night!

841
00:58:26,588 --> 00:58:29,888
宝箱にキョウミは ないけれど
I'm not interested in treasure anyway,

842
00:58:29,888 --> 00:58:34,888
ポケットにロマン それと You wanna be my Friend?
but a romance in my pocket, and "You wanna be my friend?"

843
00:58:34,888 --> 00:58:43,088
We are, We are on the cruise! ウィーアー！
We are, We are on the cruise! We are!

844
00:58:43,088 --> 00:58:49,088
ありったけの夢を かき集め
Gathering up all the pieces of our dreams,

